  "meta_harness.explainer": "Meta-Harness rewrites the best version so far and scores every candidate on all cases, so the optimization climbs instead of branching: each step keeps the best and proposes again from there.",
  "meta_harness.explainer.autoresearch": "AutoResearch runs rounds of experiments and scores every finished version on all cases. It keeps a Pareto frontier of versions that win on different cases, so later rounds can build on the leader, combine frontier members or pivot when progress stalls.",
  "meta_harness.explainer.autosaddler": "AutoSaddler diagnoses the failing cases, proposes a fix and scores every candidate on the development cases, so the optimization climbs instead of branching: each version keeps the best and refines it again.",
  "meta_harness.explainer.shinka_evolve": "ShinkaEvolve evolves versions on parallel islands: each new version edits a strong parent, is scored on all cases and joins the archive, so the optimization climbs as the best version improves.",
